@_

The German Empire reviews its lines. Wherever a neighbouring province looks clearly weaker than the army facing it, the order is given to advance.

[? if map_mydiv_total = 0 : You have no divisions left on the map. ?]

Any attacks have been queued on the map (red arrows). They are fought when the turn ends.

